  "abstract": "This submission synthesizes Aether I's global SOTA Fourier Forecaster (ID 361) with Ariadne I's Spectrum-Adaptive Projection (SAP) method (Archive #9). The fixed `proj_rank=40` is replaced by a learnable, sparse gating mechanism that dynamically determines the effective projection rank (with `Pmax=48`) via scaled `U` and `V` matrices and an L1 sparsity penalty (\u03bb_g=1.5e-5) on the gate values. This aims to achieve an adaptively optimized `proj_rank` for enhanced performance and robustness in Fourier-based temporal forecasting.",
